        <\/div>\n                            <div>\n                    <p class=\"legend\">Trace P3 Bronze Mint<\/p>\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/Trace-P3-Bronze-Mint.jpg\" class=\"image\" alt=\"Trace P3 Bronze Mint\" \/>\n                <\/div>\n                            <div>\n                    <p class=\"legend\">Capture<\/p>\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/Capture.png\" class=\"image\" alt=\"Capture\" \/>\n                <\/div>\n                            <div>\n                    <p class=\"legend\">270_amb_61_serie_Bronze_120x270___Hyper_Grey_60x120<\/p>\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/270_amb_61_serie_Bronze_120x270___Hyper_Grey_60x120.jpg\" class=\"image\" alt=\"270_amb_61_serie_Bronze_120x270___Hyper_Grey_60x120\" \/>\n                <\/div>\n                            <div>\n                    <p class=\"legend\">288_amb_61_serie_Silver_120x120_-_Lead_120x270_-_Brass_60x12<\/p>\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/288_amb_61_serie_Silver_120x120_-_Lead_120x270_-_Brass_60x12.jpg\" class=\"image\" alt=\"288_amb_61_serie_Silver_120x120_-_Lead_120x270_-_Brass_60x12\" \/>\n                <\/div>\n                            <div>\n                    <p class=\"legend\">291_amb_61_serie_White_80x80<\/p>\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/291_amb_61_serie_White_80x80.jpg\" class=\"image\" alt=\"291_amb_61_serie_White_80x80\" \/>\n                <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<section id=\"title-two-columns-block_5e0dfebb2d33c\" class=\"title-two-columns-block\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        \n        <div class=\"text\">\n            <p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Vous cherchez \u00e0 donner un aspect industriel et tendance \u00e0 votre int\u00e9rieur?<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>Le carrelage imitation b\u00e9ton saura r\u00e9pondre \u00e0 vos attentes en mati\u00e8re de d\u00e9co. Il pr\u00e9sente tous les attributs d\u2019une dalle de b\u00e9ton (texture, r\u00e9sistance, isolation) \u00e0 <strong>moindre co\u00fbt<\/strong> et en restant tr\u00e8s <strong>facile d&rsquo;entretien<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p><span>Il saura trouver sa place dans\u00a0<strong>toutes les pi\u00e8ces, <\/strong>dans vos chambres, dans votre cuisine, \u00e0 l\u2019ext\u00e9rieur, ou m\u00eame comme fa\u00efence de salle de bain.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span>Il peut \u00eatre install\u00e9 au sol, mais aussi comme rev\u00eatement mural, et pourra \u00eatre similaire \u00e0\u00a0<strong>tous les types de b\u00e9tons <\/strong>(b\u00e9ton cir\u00e9, b\u00e9ton imprim\u00e9, b\u00e9ton cir\u00e9, etc\u2026).<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span>En choisissant le carrelage imitation b\u00e9ton, vous pourrez r\u00e9aliser vos projets de d\u00e9coration int\u00e9rieure et faire de votre maison un endroit\u00a0<strong>serein<\/strong> et <strong>classieux<\/strong>.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><span>Strasbourg Carrelage vous accompagne dans vos projets de d\u00e9coration int\u00e9rieure \u00e0 Strasbourg depuis maintenant <strong>plus de 17 ans<\/strong>.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><b>Nous avons d\u00e9j\u00e0 distribu\u00e9 plus d\u2019un million de m\u00e8tres carr\u00e9s de carrelage<\/b><span> en Alsace<\/span><span>.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>Nous sommes \u00e0 vos cot\u00e9s pour comprendre vos <strong>besoins<\/strong> et vos <strong>envies<\/strong>, et pour les r\u00e9aliser avec vous.<\/p>\n<p>Nous comptons plusieurs grandes marques europ\u00e9ennes de carrelage p<span>armi nos fournisseurs.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span>Ainsi nous pouvons vous proposer\u00a0<strong>tous types de carrelage <\/strong>imitation b\u00e9ton de grande qualit\u00e9 dans notre showroom situ\u00e9 dans Grand-Est, \u00e0 Strasbourg.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n        <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<section id=\"red-content-block_5e0dff882d33d\" class=\"red-content-block simple\" style=\"background-color: #8b0936\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n            \n                            <h3 class=\"big-title\"><span><p>Int\u00e9ress\u00e9(e) par l\u2019un de ces mod\u00e8les ?<\/p>\n<\/span><\/h3>\n            \n                            <div class=\"text\">\n                    <p>Vous recherchez un style particulier ? Vous souhaitez voir d\u2019autres carrelages de ce genre ?<br \/>\nContactez-nous, nous vous proposerons d\u2019autres produits, au meilleur prix !<\/p>\n\n                <\/div>\n            \n            \n                                                <p class=\"text-center\">\n                                        <a class=\"btn btn-outline-white\" href=\"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/contact\/\" title=\"Contactez-nous\">Contactez-nous<\/a>\n                            \n                    <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>D\u00e9couvrez notre collection carrelage b\u00e9ton, pour donner \u00e0 vos pi\u00e8ces un aspect industriel et tendance \u00e0 votre int\u00e9rieur, tout en b\u00e9n\u00e9ficiant des avantages qu\u2019offre le carrelage.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":540,"parent":214,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-259","page","type-page","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/259","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=259"}],"version-history":[{"count":40,"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/259\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":951,"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/259\/revisions\/951"}],"up":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/214"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/540"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=259"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}